      "text": "Radar Chart五维指标的多系列能力对比20406080100理解分析应用表达协作5 个维度共用 0–100 分量程；均为示例评分，未混合不同单位。课程 A课程 B查看精确数据同尺度能力评分 · 分课程理解 · 分分析 · 分应用 · 分表达 · 分协作 · 分课程 A8865915674课程 B6286578269更新数据重播动效示例数据 · 已更新 0 次 · 已减少动效查看本卡代码按下列路径保存文件，在 React / Vite 宿主使用本地候选 @rain-next/ui/charts。源码使用公共入口，依赖为 Rain Foundations、React、Motion 和 GeoJSON 类型。下载 main.tsx下载 index.html下载 chart-variants/radial.tsx下载 chart-variants/shared.tsx下载 chart-variants/data/README.md下载 chart-variants/data/world.geojson下载 chart-data.ts下载 chart-catalog.ts下载 chart-examples.css查看文件 main.tsxindex.htmlchart-variants/radial.tsxchart-variants/shared.tsxchart-variants/data/README.mdchart-variants/data/world.geojsonchart-data.tschart-catalog.tschart-examples.css复制代码import { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { createRoot } from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport { MotionConfig } from \"motion/react\";\nimport \"@rain-next/foundations/tokens.css\";\nimport \"@rain-next/foundations/typography.css\";\nimport \"@rain-next/foundations/focus.css\";\nimport \"@rain-next/ui/charts/styles.css\";\nimport \"./chart-examples.css\";\nimport { RadialVariant } from \"./chart-variants/radial\";\nimport { useChartReducedMotion, type VariantSettings } from \"./chart-variants/shared\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [settings, setSettings] = useState<VariantSettings>({});\n  const [curveName, setCurveName] = useState<string | undefined>(undefined);\n  const userReduced = useChartReducedMotion();\n  const [active, setActive] = useState(!document.hidden);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const change = () => setActive(!document.hidden);\n    document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", change);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", change);\n  }, []);\n  return <MotionConfig reducedMotion=\"user\">\n    <main className=\"rain-chart\" data-recipe=\"monochrome-blue\" style={{ maxWidth: 880, margin: \"auto\", padding: \"var(--rain-space-24)\" }}>\n      <RadialVariant variantId=\"radar-default\" recipe=\"monochrome-blue\" revision={0} replay={0} reduced={true || userReduced} active={active} settings={settings} onSettingsChange={patch => setSettings(previous => ({ ...previous, ...patch }))} curveName={curveName} onCurveChange={setCurveName} />\n    </main>\n  </MotionConfig>;\n}\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(<App />);对应官网示例（新标签页打开）",
